			"notes": "#  Changelog\n## WhisperLogger Module:\nLogs your whispers locally into an .html file that tries to mimic how discord looks like. \n![Whisper Logger](https://github.com/Plumbiller/PlumbillerPublic/raw/main/src/main/resources/assets/publicaddon/docs_assets/whisperlogger.png)\n\n## Ignore Module and .ignore Command\nIgnore all messages and whispers from the players you want, using the .ignore command. Saves all ignored players into a file. The ignore command also accepts * as a wildcard so you can ignore all players with a specific pattern.\n`.ignore (add/remove) (player)` or `.ignore list`\n\n## IGN (Ignore Gray Names) Module\nIgnores the chat messages sent by players with gray name.\n\n## Modified BetterTabFix\nAdded the option to sort the tab list alphabetically id that's what you want.\n\nAlso all new features were added to the in game docs screen."
		},
