			"notes": "Added the ability for the player to config the tab TabFix module. This is a enhancement for yesterday's release.\nAlso good news for players who use a different version than 1.21.7, I made this 0.0.5 version of my module for the following minecraft versions:\n1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.7, 1.21.8, 1.21.10 and 1.21.11\n\n**EDIT**: For those 1.21.7 players I added a feature which I'm still at testing atm to allow players to scroll tablist using their mousewheel. This feature is still being tested before I add it to the rest of the versions hopefully in the next major update. You can find this enhanced version as PlumbillerPublic-1.21.7-0.0.5-BetterTabFix.jar\n\nHave fun y'all bc supporting this many versions is a pain back there.\n<img width=\"293\" height=\"887\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ce3aa88-4cc3-46b2-ac18-37b0849dfcbd\" />"
